  "findings": [
    "Main monthly-store exists; Root file absent. Separate Source extends store with Agent import/validation/settlement and payment observation. Compare dependencies and migration numbers before transport; do not rebuild or blindly copy.",
    "Root LinuxTerms has USD baseMinor=1600, CPU terms and caps; setup hashes existing consent and separates method registration from collection. serviceStartAt null=not ready, undefined=legacy. Full immutable offer/priceVersion/meter/timezone/tax/BYOK snapshot and pending_owner_terms sale closure remain missing.",
    "Root Agent monthly draft reuses sky_linux_service_documents and existing prepared payments, UTC owner/period/currency identity, 200-item hold, CAS and source digest. mode=test, baseMinor=0, draft_unreconciled, invoice=not_created, collection=disabled; never promote to common billed contract.",
    "Main/Source monthly invoice identity owner_id/period/currency/stripe_account_id is not yet common account/contract/timezone identity. Source provider recovery and reversal holds remain test candidates.",
    "Reuse lib/rock-wallet.ts, lib/wallet.ts and services/sky-billing existing reservation/ledger; no new balance ledger. USD16 base, legacy verified-revenue 888c cap, Marketplace author allocation and Sky standalone USD140 Sandbox are distinct contracts.",
    "Keep product/telecom/AI/external costs/OSS/BYOK separate. Included quantities, meter prices, tax, region, proration, rollover and grace/refund conditions remain pending; no invented prices."
  ],
  "sharedChangeRequests": [
    {
