      "request": "Persist server-built LinuxContractEnvelope alongside the accepted offer/contract without changing existing terms or consent retroactively. verifyLinuxContractSnapshot expects server-read ownerId/contractId/contractDigest/digest. Bind digest + expected revision in the same committing CAS as readiness/start/dispatch. serviceStartAt null stays pending; undefined stays legacy until explicit migration consent; signed readiness and payment-method facts are separate from digest. Add DB uniqueness on authenticated owner/contract/period/currency for the base line, not device or priceVersion. baseLineKey is only a deterministic preview identity; persistent once-only enforcement remains unimplemented. Re-pair/restart must reuse same contract/start. Existing UTC/serviceWindows proration is preserved; full_month preview does not change it. Arbitrary timezone/proration close remains BILL03/04.",
      "negativeCases": [
        "changed digest/owner/revision between read and commit: no start or dispatch",
        "null/undefined must not turn into timestamp",
        "device/re-pair/restart/version changes never insert another same-period base line",
        "pending_owner_terms must close sale and paid dispatch at real API; previews alone do not enforce it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "Git / API / Wallet single writers",
      "paths": [
        "lib/sky-linux-service-store.ts",
        "lib/sky-cloud-monthly-store.ts",
        "lib/workflow.ts",
        "app/api/sky/payments/"
      ],
      "request": "Wire optional contract binding through authenticated server routes after persistence/consent revision agreement. bindAgentMonthlyContract is a read-only sidecar and does not persist or change existing test draft/base0. Expected revision check here is not a DB CAS. Preserve current draft and source-item dedupe, account/contract identity and legacy 16USD vs 140USD sandbox provenance. BILL02 must atomically check used+holds+requested at committing dispatch with existing Wallet/cloud reservations, not rely on preview. No new ledger or Stripe transport.",
      "negativeCases": [
        "concurrent reservations above cap: one rejected by DB not pre-read only",
        "old/revoked consent at commit: no dispatch",
        "same source in monthly draft and main/Source invoice: no duplicate bill",
        "different owner/currency/product cannot be rebound"
      ]
    }
